nce:desc\", \"classifier_id:asc\"],\n  \"on_tie\": \"keep_first\",\n  \"dedupe\": \"identical_start_end_category\",\n  \"span_source\": \"span_group_if_defined_else_full_match\"\n}}\n```\n\n---\n\n## (E) REGRESSION REQUIREMENTS\n\n**Disambiguation prerequisite:** the corpus is listed as *four* documents but the name `New_Test_File.pdf` appears twice (\"plus the earlier New_Test_File.pdf variant\"). **Admin must supply a distinct identifier (sha256 or mtime) per file**, otherwise the delta table below cannot be bound to a specific artefact.\n\n### E1. Expected span-count / offset deltas under rev-002\n| Document | Classifier | rev-001 | rev-002 | Delta | Basis |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `test_file.pdf` | `CLS-PII-CC-001` | **0** | **3** | **+3** | three occurrences of `4532-\\n8910-4321-9081`; each span 20 chars |\n| `test_file.pdf` | `CLS-PII-IBAN-001` | 1 @ `[439,463]` | **1 @ `[439,466]`** | count **0**, end offset **+3** (final group ` 23` recovered) | measured relative span 9\u219236 vs 9\u219233 |\n| `test_file.pdf` | `CLS-PII-ADDRESS-001` | 1, end **364** | 1, end **\u2248341** | count **0**, end offset **\u221223** (`\\nSocial Security Number`) | 364 \u2212 len(\"\\nSocial Security Number\") = 341; \u00b11 if a trailing space is trimmed \u2014 **confirm on re-run** |\n| `test_file.pdf` | `CLS-PHI-INSURANCE-MEMBER-ID-001` | 0 (n/a) | **1 @ `[403,417]`** | **+1** | new classifier; measured span length 14 |\n| `test_file.pdf` | `CLS-PHI-MED-ID-001` | 0 | 0 | 0 | confirmed defect; unchanged unless \u00a7B5 adopted |\n| `test_file.pdf` | `CLS-PII-USERNAME-001` | 0 (n/a) | **0 expected** | 0 | no `Account:`/`Username:` label evidence in this file |\n| `Marcus Vance System Account Record.pdf` | `CLS-PII-USERNAME-001` | 0 (n/a) | **1 @ `[83,96]`** | **+1** | required match |\n| `Marcus Vance System Account Record.pdf` | all other 15 | unchanged | unchanged | **0** | no CC/IBAN/address/insurance evidence reported |\n| `New_Test_File.pdf` (current) | all | baselin